1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,057
The Lavoisier Laplace law.

2
00:00:02,057 --> 00:00:09,518
The enthalpy change of a reaction is equal in size and opposite in sign to that of the reverse reaction.

3
00:00:09,518 --> 00:00:20,260
Burning carbon releases three ninety three point five kilojoules, so decomposing carbon dioxide into carbon and oxygen needs exactly that much.

4
00:00:20,260 --> 00:00:25,690
If not, you could run the reaction round in a loop and make energy from nothing.

